From 379e66b0dfe81e7828cf2133b4fb9e762186080e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saironcb <saironbusatto@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:11:45 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 37/44] feat: pets use their hand-triggered abilities (Spell
 Lock, Seduction, Gnaw) and sane autocast

Saved bot pets had Spell Lock and Devour Magic off on every Felhunter and
Seduction/Lash of Pain off on most Succubi, and no bot code cast them. With
Playerbots.SmartPetAbilities: autocast on for self-playing abilities, off for
Cower/Phase Shift/invisibility; Felhunter Spell Lock on enemy casts (healer
first), Succubus Seduction on the enemy healer or another non-target enemy
(never one in CC or with a DoT), Ghoul Gnaw on casters in melee; DoTs "on
attacker" skip enemies held by break-on-damage CC.
